│ it to the root when truthy). I checked it with a one-off script, not the test suite: a           │
│ `FastAPI(external_docs=...)` app returns the dict under `externalDocs`, and a default app has no │
│ `externalDocs` key. The parameter sits after `separate_input_output_schemas`, so existing        │
│ positional calls are unaffected.                                                                 │
